{"chunk_id": "STD_003_C0001", "source_id": "STD_003", "title": "DB13/T 6338-2026 盐碱地梨栽培技术规程", "section": "正文（未识别章节）", "section_id": "STD_003_S001", "page": 1, "page_end": 5, "pages": [1, 3, 5], "page_basis": "PDF physical page, 1-based", "crop": ["梨"], "region": ["河北省"], "applicable_stages": [], "evidence_level": "A", "source_type": "standard", "year": 2026, "source_file_sha256": "a369ec07fcb5b82a9c8bd46ddffc72856c1218f06e10b5a655efa1169fae5335", "source_url": "https://std.samr.gov.cn/db/search/stdDBDetailed?id=598B66F9F87DC97DE06397BE0A0A7EC3", "original_path": "data/botou_yali/graphrag_corpus_v1/fulltext/standards/STD_003/original.pdf", "text": "ICS  65.020.20 CCS  B 05河北省地方标准盐碱地梨栽培技术规程2026 - 06 - 30 发布2026 - 07 - 30 实施河北省市场监督管理局  发布前言本文件按照GB/T 1.1—2020《标准化工作导则  第1部分：标准化文件的结构和起草规则》的规定起草。本文件由河北省农业农村厅提出。本文件起草单位：海兴瑞农农业发展有限公司、沧州市农林科学院、海兴县农业农村局。本文件主要起草人：郑艳丽、赵月、陈曦、张文斌、孙秀坤、姜国义、张洪宇、张立树、郭洁、王译萱、董海林、刁艳丽、常燕霞、曹华宁、武婷、陈合、李月林、王德萍、董飞、刘婧婧、杨芳媛、李清国、刘菲、张永升、苏小影、冯玉帮、梅维新、袁增勇、刘静、李英、王瑞雪。盐碱地梨栽培技术规程", "char_count": 332, "start_offset": 0, "end_offset": 332, "overlap_chars": 0, "text_sha256": "8d9f949089951fd2bd7bc819cde602857ab68c857b4613e24f5cadb0f08c338b", "size_exception": "short_section_or_tail", "review_status": "layout_tables_and_agronomic_context_review_pending", "needs_layout_review": false, "production_retrieval_approved": false}
{"chunk_id": "STD_003_C0002", "source_id": "STD_003", "title": "DB13/T 6338-2026 盐碱地梨栽培技术规程", "section": "1 范围", "section_id": "STD_003_S002", "page": 5, "page_end": 5, "pages": [5], "page_basis": "PDF physical page, 1-based", "crop": ["梨"], "region": ["河北省"], "applicable_stages": [], "evidence_level": "A", "source_type": "standard", "year": 2026, "source_file_sha256": "a369ec07fcb5b82a9c8bd46ddffc72856c1218f06e10b5a655efa1169fae5335", "source_url": "https://std.samr.gov.cn/db/search/stdDBDetailed?id=598B66F9F87DC97DE06397BE0A0A7EC3", "original_path": "data/botou_yali/graphrag_corpus_v1/fulltext/standards/STD_003/original.pdf", "text": "本文件规定了盐碱地梨栽培的建园、品种与砧木选择、栽植、土水肥管理、整形修剪、花果管理、病虫害综合防控、果实采收及采后处理和生产记录等内容。本文件适用于盐碱地梨的栽培。", "char_count": 83, "start_offset": 0, "end_offset": 83, "overlap_chars": 0, "text_sha256": "cfc0277bcccc7c66129108e935de480a34259f3aaf4f0b8308be324a4e9122a3", "size_exception": "short_section_or_tail", "review_status": "layout_tables_and_agronomic_context_review_pending", "needs_layout_review": false, "production_retrieval_approved": false}
{"chunk_id": "STD_003_C0003", "source_id": "STD_003", "title": "DB13/T 6338-2026 盐碱地梨栽培技术规程", "section": "2 规范性引用文件", "section_id": "STD_003_S003", "page": 5, "page_end": 5, "pages": [5], "page_basis": "PDF physical page, 1-based", "crop": ["梨"], "region": ["河北省"], "applicable_stages": [], "evidence_level": "A", "source_type": "standard", "year": 2026, "source_file_sha256": "a369ec07fcb5b82a9c8bd46ddffc72856c1218f06e10b5a655efa1169fae5335", "source_url": "https://std.samr.gov.cn/db/search/stdDBDetailed?id=598B66F9F87DC97DE06397BE0A0A7EC3", "original_path": "data/botou_yali/graphrag_corpus_v1/fulltext/standards/STD_003/original.pdf", "text": "下列文件中的内容通过文中的规范性引用而构成本文件必不可少的条款。其中，注日期的引用文件，仅该日期对应的版本适用于本文件；不注日期的引用文件，其最新版本（包括所有的修改单）适用于本文件。GB 5084 农田灌溉水质标准GB/T 42828.3 盐碱地改良通用技术 第3部分：生物改良NY/T 442-2013 梨生产技术规程NY 475 梨苗木NY/T 496 肥料合理使用准则 通则NY/T 2157 梨主要病虫害防治技术规程DB13/T 5778 苹果、梨全程机械化生产技术规程DB13/T 5904-2024 红皮梨生产技术规程", "char_count": 266, "start_offset": 0, "end_offset": 266, "overlap_chars": 0, "text_sha256": "86de991f99efeee6f2b177dee5468252b1f53a2d9c99fbe367a14b4559405c9e", "size_exception": "short_section_or_tail", "review_status": "layout_tables_and_agronomic_context_review_pending", "needs_layout_review": false, "production_retrieval_approved": false}
{"chunk_id": "STD_003_C0004", "source_id": "STD_003", "title": "DB13/T 6338-2026 盐碱地梨栽培技术规程", "section": "3 术语和定义", "section_id": "STD_003_S004", "page": 5, "page_end": 5, "pages": [5], "page_basis": "PDF physical page, 1-based", "crop": ["梨"], "region": ["河北省"], "applicable_stages": [], "evidence_level": "A", "source_type": "standard", "year": 2026, "source_file_sha256": "a369ec07fcb5b82a9c8bd46ddffc72856c1218f06e10b5a655efa1169fae5335", "source_url": "https://std.samr.gov.cn/db/search/stdDBDetailed?id=598B66F9F87DC97DE06397BE0A0A7EC3", "original_path": "data/botou_yali/graphrag_corpus_v1/fulltext/standards/STD_003/original.pdf", "text": "本文件没有需要界定的术语和定义。", "char_count": 16, "start_offset": 0, "end_offset": 16, "overlap_chars": 0, "text_sha256": "26bcec08abaf989879de11bb095b4a85a5d1905d14476ded45dc3dd6c060f3c9", "size_exception": "short_section_or_tail", "review_status": "layout_tables_and_agronomic_context_review_pending", "needs_layout_review": false, "production_retrieval_approved": false}
{"chunk_id": "STD_003_C0005", "source_id": "STD_003", "title": "DB13/T 6338-2026 盐碱地梨栽培技术规程", "section": "4 建园", "section_id": "STD_003_S005", "page": 5, "page_end": 5, "pages": [5], "page_basis": "PDF physical page, 1-based", "crop": ["梨"], "region": ["河北省"], "applicable_stages": [], "evidence_level": "A", "source_type": "standard", "year": 2026, "source_file_sha256": "a369ec07fcb5b82a9c8bd46ddffc72856c1218f06e10b5a655efa1169fae5335", "source_url": "https://std.samr.gov.cn/db/search/stdDBDetailed?id=598B66F9F87DC97DE06397BE0A0A7EC3", "original_path": "data/botou_yali/graphrag_corpus_v1/fulltext/standards/STD_003/original.pdf", "text": "土壤条件宜选择土层深厚、pH 7.1～8.5、含盐量0.1%～0.3%的沙壤质或中壤质潮土地块。园地规划按NY/T 442-2013中3.3的规定执行，栽植前平整土地并建立良好的灌溉和排水系统。盐碱地改良可采用下列措施：——工程改良，利用灌溉和排水系统灌排淋洗土壤盐分；——生物改良，综合利用微生物肥料、有机肥料和秸秆等生物资源，或通过种植绿肥、耐盐植物等技术方法，使土壤得到改良，按GB/T 42828.3的规定执行；——化学改良，施用土壤改良剂降低pH和碱化度。", "char_count": 233, "start_offset": 0, "end_offset": 233, "overlap_chars": 0, "text_sha256": "ff72e690d831c64a2b7c49116417002f2410f6ae59d07db29a39c8c81ddfc24c", "size_exception": "short_section_or_tail", "review_status": "layout_tables_and_agronomic_context_review_pending", "needs_layout_review": false, "production_retrieval_approved": false}
{"chunk_id": "STD_003_C0006", "source_id": "STD_003", "title": "DB13/T 6338-2026 盐碱地梨栽培技术规程", "section": "5 品种和砧木选择", "section_id": "STD_003_S006", "page": 5, "page_end": 6, "pages": [5, 6], "page_basis": "PDF physical page, 1-based", "crop": ["梨"], "region": ["河北省"], "applicable_stages": [], "evidence_level": "A", "source_type": "standard", "year": 2026, "source_file_sha256": "a369ec07fcb5b82a9c8bd46ddffc72856c1218f06e10b5a655efa1169fae5335", "source_url": "https://std.samr.gov.cn/db/search/stdDBDetailed?id=598B66F9F87DC97DE06397BE0A0A7EC3", "original_path": "data/botou_yali/graphrag_corpus_v1/fulltext/standards/STD_003/original.pdf", "text": "品种选择选择适宜当地种植的传统梨品种和经审定的耐盐碱优质梨品种。砧木选择宜选择耐盐碱的杜梨砧木。苗木质量应选用NY 475规定的二级以上的苗木。", "char_count": 72, "start_offset": 0, "end_offset": 72, "overlap_chars": 0, "text_sha256": "3f91b535171864d8eaabc6e0490061d83b8d7c2f13808a10671358ebcd9ac9b0", "size_exception": "short_section_or_tail", "review_status": "layout_tables_and_agronomic_context_review_pending", "needs_layout_review": false, "production_retrieval_approved": false}
{"chunk_id": "STD_003_C0007", "source_id": "STD_003", "title": "DB13/T 6338-2026 盐碱地梨栽培技术规程", "section": "6 栽植", "section_id": "STD_003_S007", "page": 6, "page_end": 6, "pages": [6], "page_basis": "PDF physical page, 1-based", "crop": ["梨"], "region": ["河北省"], "applicable_stages": [], "evidence_level": "A", "source_type": "standard", "year": 2026, "source_file_sha256": "a369ec07fcb5b82a9c8bd46ddffc72856c1218f06e10b5a655efa1169fae5335", "source_url": "https://std.samr.gov.cn/db/search/stdDBDetailed?id=598B66F9F87DC97DE06397BE0A0A7EC3", "original_path": "data/botou_yali/graphrag_corpus_v1/fulltext/standards/STD_003/original.pdf", "text": "栽植时间春季栽植为宜。栽培模式按DB13/T 5778的规定执行。栽植方法南北行向。挖宽、深各80 cm的栽植沟，表土与底土分开。底部回填20 cm左右的作物秸秆，每亩施腐熟农家肥8 t～10 t，与表土混匀回填，灌水浇透、沉实。再挖直径40 cm、深40 cm的定植穴，苗木栽植后，在60 cm～80 cm处定干，灌水浇透，覆膜保墒。", "char_count": 168, "start_offset": 0, "end_offset": 168, "overlap_chars": 0, "text_sha256": "18ca5ef58f50ac9d3cc534c1ff4750926338e0624f003782d74459a992fa572a", "size_exception": "short_section_or_tail", "review_status": "layout_tables_and_agronomic_context_review_pending", "needs_layout_review": false, "production_retrieval_approved": false}
{"chunk_id": "STD_003_C0008", "source_id": "STD_003", "title": "DB13/T 6338-2026 盐碱地梨栽培技术规程", "section": "7 土肥水管理", "section_id": "STD_003_S008", "page": 6, "page_end": 6, "pages": [6], "page_basis": "PDF physical page, 1-based", "crop": ["梨"], "region": ["河北省"], "applicable_stages": [], "evidence_level": "A", "source_type": "standard", "year": 2026, "source_file_sha256": "a369ec07fcb5b82a9c8bd46ddffc72856c1218f06e10b5a655efa1169fae5335", "source_url": "https://std.samr.gov.cn/db/search/stdDBDetailed?id=598B66F9F87DC97DE06397BE0A0A7EC3", "original_path": "data/botou_yali/graphrag_corpus_v1/fulltext/standards/STD_003/original.pdf", "text": "土壤管理", "char_count": 4, "start_offset": 0, "end_offset": 4, "overlap_chars": 0, "text_sha256": "4a0c388ab94a8b1e389e55636a252ac4720540c705d8a6521c8f234f4946513a", "size_exception": "short_section_or_tail", "review_status": "layout_tables_and_agronomic_context_review_pending", "needs_layout_review": false, "production_retrieval_approved": false}
{"chunk_id": "STD_003_C0009", "source_id": "STD_003", "title": "DB13/T 6338-2026 盐碱地梨栽培技术规程", "section": "7.1.1 深翻改土", "section_id": "STD_003_S009", "page": 6, "page_end": 6, "pages": [6], "page_basis": "PDF physical page, 1-based", "crop": ["梨"], "region": ["河北省"], "applicable_stages": [], "evidence_level": "A", "source_type": "standard", "year": 2026, "source_file_sha256": "a369ec07fcb5b82a9c8bd46ddffc72856c1218f06e10b5a655efa1169fae5335", "source_url": "https://std.samr.gov.cn/db/search/stdDBDetailed?id=598B66F9F87DC97DE06397BE0A0A7EC3", "original_path": "data/botou_yali/graphrag_corpus_v1/fulltext/standards/STD_003/original.pdf", "text": "按NY/T 442-2013中5.1.1的规定执行。", "char_count": 26, "start_offset": 0, "end_offset": 26, "overlap_chars": 0, "text_sha256": "17f542b98035368dc01e626cdaf2f8e88f8986c40e5ef942b8a877a6d122f5b9", "size_exception": "short_section_or_tail", "review_status": "layout_tables_and_agronomic_context_review_pending", "needs_layout_review": false, "production_retrieval_approved": false}
{"chunk_id": "STD_003_C0010", "source_id": "STD_003", "title": "DB13/T 6338-2026 盐碱地梨栽培技术规程", "section": "7.1.2 行间生草", "section_id": "STD_003_S010", "page": 6, "page_end": 6, "pages": [6], "page_basis": "PDF physical page, 1-based", "crop": ["梨"], "region": ["河北省"], "applicable_stages": [], "evidence_level": "A", "source_type": "standard", "year": 2026, "source_file_sha256": "a369ec07fcb5b82a9c8bd46ddffc72856c1218f06e10b5a655efa1169fae5335", "source_url": "https://std.samr.gov.cn/db/search/stdDBDetailed?id=598B66F9F87DC97DE06397BE0A0A7EC3", "original_path": "data/botou_yali/graphrag_corpus_v1/fulltext/standards/STD_003/original.pdf", "text": "选择适宜当地的耐盐碱绿肥或自然生草，定期刈割，留茬10 cm～15 cm。", "char_count": 37, "start_offset": 0, "end_offset": 37, "overlap_chars": 0, "text_sha256": "37ee4d6bcc7ed5b457792b7ae452cff48c08bbfd81865c7a1e2e89a5fb08f27e", "size_exception": "short_section_or_tail", "review_status": "layout_tables_and_agronomic_context_review_pending", "needs_layout_review": false, "production_retrieval_approved": false}
{"chunk_id": "STD_003_C0011", "source_id": "STD_003", "title": "DB13/T 6338-2026 盐碱地梨栽培技术规程", "section": "7.1.3 果园覆盖", "section_id": "STD_003_S011", "page": 6, "page_end": 6, "pages": [6], "page_basis": "PDF physical page, 1-based", "crop": ["梨"], "region": ["河北省"], "applicable_stages": [], "evidence_level": "A", "source_type": "standard", "year": 2026, "source_file_sha256": "a369ec07fcb5b82a9c8bd46ddffc72856c1218f06e10b5a655efa1169fae5335", "source_url": "https://std.samr.gov.cn/db/search/stdDBDetailed?id=598B66F9F87DC97DE06397BE0A0A7EC3", "original_path": "data/botou_yali/graphrag_corpus_v1/fulltext/standards/STD_003/original.pdf", "text": "秸秆覆盖按NY/T 442-2013中5.1.3的规定执行；也可覆盖黑色园艺地布。施肥管理", "char_count": 45, "start_offset": 0, "end_offset": 45, "overlap_chars": 0, "text_sha256": "df57d6925fa0737aa3574ed69d73e469acc2f5c30fe6f2aacb9533f5437cdff7", "size_exception": "short_section_or_tail", "review_status": "layout_tables_and_agronomic_context_review_pending", "needs_layout_review": false, "production_retrieval_approved": false}
{"chunk_id": "STD_003_C0012", "source_id": "STD_003", "title": "DB13/T 6338-2026 盐碱地梨栽培技术规程", "section": "7.2.1 施肥原则", "section_id": "STD_003_S012", "page": 6, "page_end": 6, "pages": [6], "page_basis": "PDF physical page, 1-based", "crop": ["梨"], "region": ["河北省"], "applicable_stages": [], "evidence_level": "A", "source_type": "standard", "year": 2026, "source_file_sha256": "a369ec07fcb5b82a9c8bd46ddffc72856c1218f06e10b5a655efa1169fae5335", "source_url": "https://std.samr.gov.cn/db/search/stdDBDetailed?id=598B66F9F87DC97DE06397BE0A0A7EC3", "original_path": "data/botou_yali/graphrag_corpus_v1/fulltext/standards/STD_003/original.pdf", "text": "增施有机肥，提倡配方施肥。肥料使用按NY/T 496的规定执行。", "char_count": 32, "start_offset": 0, "end_offset": 32, "overlap_chars": 0, "text_sha256": "f145d92b1106281df5a7456b4def8df0a01a2178e5cbaf9fa917b341e837a187", "size_exception": "short_section_or_tail", "review_status": "layout_tables_and_agronomic_context_review_pending", "needs_layout_review": false, "production_retrieval_approved": false}
{"chunk_id": "STD_003_C0013", "source_id": "STD_003", "title": "DB13/T 6338-2026 盐碱地梨栽培技术规程", "section": "7.2.2 基肥", "section_id": "STD_003_S013", "page": 6, "page_end": 6, "pages": [6], "page_basis": "PDF physical page, 1-based", "crop": ["梨"], "region": ["河北省"], "applicable_stages": [], "evidence_level": "A", "source_type": "standard", "year": 2026, "source_file_sha256": "a369ec07fcb5b82a9c8bd46ddffc72856c1218f06e10b5a655efa1169fae5335", "source_url": "https://std.samr.gov.cn/db/search/stdDBDetailed?id=598B66F9F87DC97DE06397BE0A0A7EC3", "original_path": "data/botou_yali/graphrag_corpus_v1/fulltext/standards/STD_003/original.pdf", "text": "秋季施入，以充分腐熟的农家肥为主，按环状沟、条沟、放射沟施用，亩施2 t～3 t。", "char_count": 41, "start_offset": 0, "end_offset": 41, "overlap_chars": 0, "text_sha256": "4ed7330c420d08f3de147aaf7fe5ee67e5c6471b1305d269b30059d610c7cdb5", "size_exception": "short_section_or_tail", "review_status": "layout_tables_and_agronomic_context_review_pending", "needs_layout_review": false, "production_retrieval_approved": false}
{"chunk_id": "STD_003_C0014", "source_id": "STD_003", "title": "DB13/T 6338-2026 盐碱地梨栽培技术规程", "section": "7.2.3 追肥", "section_id": "STD_003_S014", "page": 6, "page_end": 6, "pages": [6], "page_basis": "PDF physical page, 1-based", "crop": ["梨"], "region": ["河北省"], "applicable_stages": [], "evidence_level": "A", "source_type": "standard", "year": 2026, "source_file_sha256": "a369ec07fcb5b82a9c8bd46ddffc72856c1218f06e10b5a655efa1169fae5335", "source_url": "https://std.samr.gov.cn/db/search/stdDBDetailed?id=598B66F9F87DC97DE06397BE0A0A7EC3", "original_path": "data/botou_yali/graphrag_corpus_v1/fulltext/standards/STD_003/original.pdf", "text": "根据树型大小，开花前株施高氮复合肥0.5 kg～1.0 kg；果实膨大期株施高钾复合肥0.5 kg～1.0 kg，每间隔7 d～10 d喷施2～3次的磷酸二氢钾或草木灰浸出液。水分管理灌水时间应根据土壤墒情而定，通常在萌芽前、落花后、果实膨大期和土壤封冻前各浇1次水，宜采用滴灌、渗灌等节水灌溉方法，灌水应符合GB 5084的规定。当雨水过大时，利用沟渠及时排水洗盐。", "char_count": 184, "start_offset": 0, "end_offset": 184, "overlap_chars": 0, "text_sha256": "54c31185c9be4a8e2c5bfc8a78a967553e22746aeb8dcf5d71160791898b1140", "size_exception": "short_section_or_tail", "review_status": "layout_tables_and_agronomic_context_review_pending", "needs_layout_review": false, "production_retrieval_approved": false}
